        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri Kohasi nimwo haakomookire omuryango gw'aba Amuraamu, n'ogw'aba Izuhaari, n'ogw'aba Heburooni, n'ogw'aba Uzieli; egyo niyo miryango y'aba Kohasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeetwa abashaija boona okwiha aha beereere abahikize okwezi kumwe bakaba bari enkumi munaana na magana mukaaga, abaakwatsiibwe eby'Omwanya ogurikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emiryango ya beene Kohasi egume eteere amahema gaayo aha rubaju rw'Obutaaho orw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omwebembezi w'enju ya baishenkurubo omu miryango y'aba Kohasi abe Elizafaani mwene Uzieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi baraakwatsibwe bibe eshanduukye y'endagaano, emeeza, ekikondo ky'amatabaaza, n'amatambiro, n'ebintu by'Omwanya ogurikwera ebirikukoresibwa abanyamurwa n'omukingo gwaho, kandi n'emirimo yaabyo yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Eleazaari mwene Arooni omunyamurwa abe niwe yaaba omukuru w'abeebembezi b'Abaleevi, areeberere abakwatsiibwe eby'Omwanya ogurikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri Merari nimwo haakomookire omuryango gw'aba Mahili, n'ogw'aba Muushi; egyo niyo miryango y'aba Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'omuribo abarikwetwa abashaija boona okwiha aha beereere abahikize okwezi kumwe bakaba bari enkumi mukaaga na magana abiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukuru w'enju ya baishenkurubo omu miryango ya Merari akaba ari Zurieli mwene Abihaili; abo bagume bateere amahema gaabo aha rubaju rw'Obutaaho orw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi beene Merari baraakwatsibwe bibe embaaho z'Obutaaho n'embazi zaazo n'enyomyo zaabwo n'ebiina byazo n'ebintu byabyo byona, kandi n'emirimo yaabyo yoona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi n'enyomyo z'orugo orwehinguririize ekibuga, n'ebiina byazo n'enkondo zaazo n'emirunga yaazo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
